.THS Delold 8L News.SH NAME$N - delete unconditional old article..SH SYNOPSISdelold <days>.SH DESCRIPTION$N scans through all news directories, checks the creation date anddeletes an article if it is older than.BR <days> .This can be used if some problems has occured (e.g. a corrupted historyfile) which disables a proper expire..SH PROBLEMS$N deletes without asking if this is okay and you can only scan thewhole news subdirectories. It is not possible to just delete somesubgroups.